{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45786","headline":"读玄宗幸蜀记 · 贯休","name":"读玄宗幸蜀记","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宋璟姚崇死，中庸遂变移。\n如何游万里，祗爲一胡儿。\n泣溻乾坤色，飘零日月旗。\n火从龙阙起，泪向马嵬垂。\n始忆张丞相，全师郭子仪。\n百官皆剽劫，九庙尽崩隳。\n尘扑银轮暗，雷奔栈阁危。\n幸臣方赐死，野老不胜悲。\n及溜飘沦日，行宫寂寞时。\n人心虽未厌，天意亦难知。\n圣两归丹禁，承乾动四夷。\n因知纳谏诤，始是太平基。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45786.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45786","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}